# captured 2026-08-30 from /proc/<pid>/maps. Read sequentially at boot by
# ultima-prefetch (ultima-prefetch.service) before the app is exec'd.
# Missing files are skipped, so a Qt/Mesa version bump only makes this
# list stale, never breaks boot — regenerate it (see ultima-prefetch).
